WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
agrees with it. I mean, I was very proud to see this morning have the highest poll numbers

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.340
I've ever had. Part of it is because of what we've done on the border. I guess the other

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:13.600
part is what we've done in the economy. Joe Biden's policies empowered murderous gangs,

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:19.080
human smugglers, child traffickers, drug cartels and prisoners, prisoners from all over the

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:19.440
world.

